{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkt1zPGJQ7KDtxujwTZH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with what the page puts on top. That's a Pesagot securities account (פסגות) holding the fund \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\", number 5139282. I'm fairly sure about it. It decided it for me by saying \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול\" and showing 86,492 ₪ at the end. The other fund it suggests ends only 43 ₪ lower, so choosing between them isn't worth the stress. The fund fee is 0.02%. What scared me was the big pink bar: about 6,900 ₪ in costs over 10 years, and most of it is \"מס\". I didn't really get whether that's on top of the fees.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Heading:** \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". S&P 500 was already picked, so I knew I was in the right place.\n- **Sliders:** They were set to 10,000 today, 500 a month, 10 years and 7%. I have 30,000, but I left them alone. All my numbers are for 10k, not my 30k.\n- **Big numbers:** The first I saw was 70,000 ₪ (what I put in), then 86,492 ₪ for \"הבחירה שלכם\", and 86,449 for the next pair.\n- **Cost bar:** Pink 5,703 ₪. I checked the legend once: pink is \"מס\". The orange and yellow bits are account fees, I think. I didn't read the cost colours properly.\n- **Two cards:** One for Pesagot (\"מה החשבון גובה ב־10 שנים: 1,057 ₪\") and one for the Yalin fund (\"0.02% נאמן\").\n- **Fund list (19 funds):** I scrolled fast. I saw minus numbers on the left: −213, −447, up to −4,492, and one \"בין 2,212+ ל־23,766−\" ₪. Those scared me off everything except the top one.\n- **Bank list:** Pesagot first. Leumi second at 83,396 ₪, so the bank I know costs about 3,000 more. Mizrahi, Altshuler and Excellence were far behind with red bars.\n- **Section \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריף\":** I only noticed Pesagot's ad says \"פטור מלא מדמי ניהול\" but the price list has \"דמי משמרת 0.12%\" (0.03% in the end). That bothered me a bit.\n- **\"מה הכי משנה\":** Years matter most, \"19,116 ₪ יותר\" if I go to 12 years. That's the one thing I really took from it: stay in long.\n- **Chart section \"עם נטרול מט\"ח או בלי\":** Lots of percentages and bar charts. I skimmed it, didn't get it and moved on.\n- **Last big chart:** Starting point \"ירושלים\" at 79,176, then +4,972 for switching account to Pesagot, then +2,344 for switching fund, ending at 86,492. That's what made it click for me.\n- **Bottom:** Grey text, skipped.\n\n**What I skipped:** The small print under the charts, the \"למה חלק מהקרנות בלי מחיר\" section, the \"חוקים וכללים\" links and the whole currency-chart section.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"(4D)\" and \"(4A)\", \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\", \"צוברת\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"נאמן\", \"עסקת החלף\", \"מס נגבה על שינוי המטבע\", \"UCITS\", \"W-8BEN\", \"עוד לא נאסף\", \"מול המדד\".\n\n**Where I got stuck:**\n- Near the top of the fund list a box (\"מס רק במכירה\") sat on top of the rows, so I couldn't read the funds under it.\n- There's a sticky bar (\"מקור / מדריך / השקעה במדד…\") covering half of the first screen.\n- Around the currency charts (screen 4) I'd have closed the page on the bus.\n- Nothing tells me the first thing to actually do: open the account how? Buy where? The only \"do something\" link was \"הוספת חשבון בתנאים שקיבלתם\", which isn't for me."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1084,"cache_read_input_tokens":22074,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1084},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"905eff99-5df9-4a5a-8e89-da8cb332db2b","uuid":"2a1068cf-100e-4851-b3c2-7b3f945c4cf4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:24:48.193Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkt1zA85kY6RS6KDpJji"}
